        {
         "id": "b_3un4e7qb",
         "type": "text",
         "props": {
          "html": "<p>The practical bit: join at Bergen from two, sail at five. The airport bus stops a short walk from the berth, and we book the flights where wanted, under the ATOL. Skua is a ship of stairs, and ashore is mostly by gangway in the arms. Travel insurance is a condition of booking.</p>"
         }
        }
       ]
